<Positioned left="56" top="1574" width="172" height="18"><Container alignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="12" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">扫码登记（示意图形）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1396"><Text fontSize="22" color="#1E2A22FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">登记与借种</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1432" width="920" height="24"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="16" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">线上登记后 1 个工作日内收到借种卡编号；凭编号到服务站领取种子。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1462" width="920" height="24"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="16" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">云栖里社区服务站 1 楼 · 每周二、四 14:00–18:00</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1494" width="920" height="24"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">留种提示：采收后请把最健壮的 3 株留到最后，种子完全成熟再剪下阴干。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1526" width="920" height="24"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">会员每季可借 5 包种子；种子来源为上一季会员归还与社区交换。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1560"><Container width="920" height="1" color="#E3DED0FF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1568" width="920" height="18"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="12" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">本作品为 Snapshot DSL 演示：项目、人物、数据均为虚构，未使用任何外部图片素材。 农场、社区与活动日期均为虚构演示。</Text></Container></Positioned>
